  "prefLabel": "Per-A 102.03 Appellant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 102.03 “Appellant” means the party seeking modification or reversal of a decision of the appointing authority or of the director of personnel.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Per-A 100) #7377, eff 10-23-00",
